  "body": "<section class=\"outreach-title body-section\"><div class=\"section-child\"><h1 class=\"heading-31\">Outreach 2021-2022</h1></div></section><section class=\"award-block\"><div class=\"section-child row align-center\"><img src=\"/assets/802b012dc107aadf-65a5734acfb297661455e0f5_Copy_of_IMG_3280.JPG\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 94vw, 200px\" srcset=\"/assets/46192136b32d6cb0-65a5734acfb297661455e0f5_Copy_of_IMG_3280-p-500.jpg 500w, /assets/c502fa43b5cc4ee4-65a5734acfb297661455e0f5_Copy_of_IMG_3280-p-800.jpg 800w, /assets/d5f2ae34dbc07933-65a5734acfb297661455e0f5_Copy_of_IMG_3280-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /assets/bafdd9ddf6e1f798-65a5734acfb297661455e0f5_Copy_of_IMG_3280-p-1600.jpg 1600w, /assets/3a85f96798921e8c-65a5734acfb297661455e0f5_Copy_of_IMG_3280-p-2000.jpg 2000w, /assets/eff225bb8020cd13-65a5734acfb297661455e0f5_Copy_of_IMG_3280-p-2600.jpg 2600w, /assets/6910694a6414703f-65a5734acfb297661455e0f5_Copy_of_IMG_3280-p-3200.jpg 3200w, /assets/802b012dc107aadf-65a5734acfb297661455e0f5_Copy_of_IMG_3280.JPG 4032w\" class=\"image-34\"><div><h1 class=\"less-bottom-margin\">Highlander Robotics Day</h1><p class=\"a-bit-bigger-aand-gray\">05/2022</p><p>Piedmont Mayor named May 22, 2022 as Highlander Robotics day in recognition of our first ever appearance at Worlds in Houston; a successful first season of in person competitions; and for our leadership in promoting STEM in our community and representing PHS at the championship for the first time ever.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"award-block\"><div class=\"section-child row align-center\"><img src=\"/assets/f9bba40a9f0ab298-65cd58926a05c202e9f0e3ce_Screen_Shot_2024-02-14_at_4.19.19_PM.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 88vw, (max-width: 767px) 406.859375px, 200px\" srcset=\"/assets/f274a22f36d82043-65cd58926a05c202e9f0e3ce_Screen_Shot_2024-02-14_at_4.19.19_PM-p-500.png 500w, /assets/ada124c4ad3b7fc4-65cd58926a05c202e9f0e3ce_Screen_Shot_2024-02-14_at_4.19.19_PM-p-800.png 800w, /assets/e22fa1b1db600959-65cd58926a05c202e9f0e3ce_Screen_Shot_2024-02-14_at_4.19.19_PM-p-1080.png 1080w, /assets/f9bba40a9f0ab298-65cd58926a05c202e9f0e3ce_Screen_Shot_2024-02-14_at_4.19.19_PM.png 1422w\" class=\"image-34\"><div><h1 class=\"less-bottom-margin\">Engineering Lab Open House</h1><p class=\"a-bit-bigger-aand-gray\">05/2022</p><p>Highlander team members assemble new tools purchased for the new Engineering lab and hosted a Robotics Open House with Piedmont Makers. Highlander team members talked about the FIRST Robotics Competition program to recruit new members. All of this paved the way for the immense team growth we saw this year.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"award-block\"><div class=\"section-child row align-center\"><img src=\"/assets/981bc416154a3183-65cd59595b1e8fbd18465fee_Screen_Shot_2024-02-14_at_4.22.32_PM.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 94vw, 200px\" srcset=\"/assets/816d32260186d641-65cd59595b1e8fbd18465fee_Screen_Shot_2024-02-14_at_4.22.32_PM-p-500.png 500w, /assets/820229c19b40ef19-65cd59595b1e8fbd18465fee_Screen_Shot_2024-02-14_at_4.22.32_PM-p-800.png 800w, /assets/98f5adbbffaf9e70-65cd59595b1e8fbd18465fee_Screen_Shot_2024-02-14_at_4.22.32_PM-p-1080.png 1080w, /assets/981bc416154a3183-65cd59595b1e8fbd18465fee_Screen_Shot_2024-02-14_at_4.22.32_PM.png 1490w\" class=\"image-34\"><div><h1 class=\"less-bottom-margin\">Field Trips</h1><p class=\"a-bit-bigger-aand-gray\">Throughout 2021-2022 Season</p><p>8033 toured Atomic Machines, which provided unique learning opportunities for the students on our team that would not be available otherwise, as these facilities are not public. This trio also provided insight into engineering career paths and their experience.</p></div></div></section>"
}